                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I got hooked on the early version of this game on the Amiga, in 1986. I spent my early internet years (1996-2000) playing it by email with people around the world. I absolutely loved it.\r\nThis new version? I love this too. The random map generator's a bit lame - not bad, just lame. But otherwise, I'd still play the shit out of this game if there was still a PBNEM community around to play it. Because the AI's a bit like the random map generator, in that it exists, and is workable, it's not really going to give you an experience to write home about.\r\nAnyone who is up for a long slow PBEM game of this, drop me a line. I'd totally be up for it.",
